178009886707352184_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nlbq1VThElUQ7kNvwGpufcU&_nc_oc=AdmDSSDU4w-YvEAXYH5HYSbLS8KOVBtiFf1gsYWNRcYzgdtkRTBIucQPHRhZsnMmj3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvpM9cPPjIU6xhJfkBiA8DI-hWKVNzNyRilfIVXa5IfsQ&oe=69A1805B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TaskTitan_2560x1440.png", "id": "318678027752199", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982572_318678031085532_2872445775829117351_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AzQB2K6OM4kQ7kNvwHCQ8-1&_nc_oc=AdmIXNGIV9_8wvTRIKUaZ0V1Yh74hp_gNvItUt1rYMPyMGZBBU6kn40LfdSM6yRBmdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftydvXINyV5KtCoPqDWr8dTx27sPZLrZW124llUa4qTbg&oe=69A1A530"}, "display_name": "Task Titans", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Task Titans is a series of 3 virtual reality mini games intended to teach the player project management concepts. \n\nDefeat Gremlins:\nOvercome risks and issues by battling gremlins, enhancing your problem-solving skills.\n\nBridge Building: \nConstruct one of multiples bridges types,  applying project management principles to ensure success.\n\nResource Management & Team Coordination:\nManage resources wisely and work with a team to bring your bridge project to completion.\n\nLearn Valuable Life Skills:\nGain insights into leadership, teamwork, strategic planning, and adaptability through real-life project scenarios.\n \nExperience:\nWhether a beginner or a seasoned pro, \"The Task Titans\" offers a fun and educational way to sharpen your project management skills.", "short_description": "Jump into the role of a project manager in \"The Task Titans,\" where you'll tackle various challenges from saving spaceships to constructing bridges and solving treasure maps."}]}, "developer_name": "START", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://taleoconnects.com/privacypolicy-tasktitans", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taleo", "su